      <color>(105,95,97)</color>
      <colorTwo>(155,133,107)</colorTwo>
    </graphicData>
    <description>Deposits of steel. Steel has a variety of uses as an economic metal, being abundant and easy to process. It can be strengthened by being mixed with other metals into alloys.</description>
